{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Cap Child Maintenance payments at \u00a3200 per child",
        "additional_details": "Doing this will, we believe, help reduce the stress and financial difficulties that many face when it comes to having to pay Child Maintenance and will make it more equal and fair to both parties when each has a share of the care of each child. Currently, we feel it is an unjustified system which only benefits the receiving party.",
        "background": "We want Child Maintenance payments to be capped to a maximum of \u00a3200 per child \u2013 rather than to be based on pre-tax income \u2013 and to be reduced according to the proportion of days\u2019 care given by the paying parent.",
        "closed_at": null,
